@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ArrowColor #C62828
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C62828
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
title Remove a student's attendance
box "Logic" #C8C8FA
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "unmark:UnmarkCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box
box "Model" #F97181
participant "pending:ModelManager" as Pending MODEL_COLOR
end box
[-> Logic : Remove attendance entry
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : Parse command
activate Parser
Parser --> Logic : Unmark command
deactivate Parser
create Pending
Logic -> Pending : Create pending copy
Pending --> Logic : Pending model
Logic -> Command : Execute on pending model
activate Command
Command -> Pending : Read all students
Pending --> Command : Student list
Command -> Command : Find student by ID
Command -> Command : Find matching date and group in student's records
note over Command
Attendance belongs to the student, across groups.
Current group membership is not required.
end note
Command -> Pending : Replace student with record removed
Command --> Logic : Unmark result
deactivate Command
ref over Logic, Pending : Save before publishing (shared flow)
[<-- Logic : Result
deactivate Logic
@enduml
